        <h1>A little more<br>room to <em>breathe.</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-description">Make sense of the moment you’re in. Mind Ease brings gentle CBT reflections, mood check-ins and calming practices into one private space.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-light" href="/register">Begin your check-in <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link text-link-light" href="#how-it-helps">Take a look <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
